Shaman Epic Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Shaman Epic Quest","wikiPath":"/Shaman_Epic_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Various","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"a lesser spirit","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Opaque Gem","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Opaque_Gem"},{"name":"Black Dire","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Black_Dire"},{"name":"Black Dire Pelt","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Black_Dire_Pelt"},{"name":"Child's Tear","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Child%27s_Tear"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Shield of Falsehood","item":"Shield of Falsehood","wikiPath":"/Shield_of_Falsehood"},{"text":"Black Fur Boots","item":"Black Fur Boots","wikiPath":"/Black_Fur_Boots"},{"text":"Spear of Fate","item":"Spear of Fate","wikiPath":"/Spear_of_Fate"}],"card":{"title":"Shaman Epic Quest","lines":["Recommended Level: 46+","Classes: Shaman","Related Zones: Various","Related NPCs: Various","Faction note: Simply target the spawned spirit, and hit your macro. He'll hand you a Tiny Gem. You then Gate to Freeport, and turn the gem into Bondl. The cleric will then cast a 0% resurrection on your corpse, and you'll pop back up next to the spirit in Butcher Block. Simply hit your macro again, and receive another gem. You can canni 2-3 times to get mana back for a gate, and gate again to turn in the gem. Repeat until MAX faction. Just having ally faction will not get you your spear, so unless you get a message saying \"Your faction with True Spirit can not get any better,\" DO NOT do the final turn in! YOU NEED MAX ALLY FOR THE FINAL \"Scale\" TURN IN. IF YOU DON'T HAVE MAX ALLY, YOUR SCALE WILL BE EATEN."]},"links":["A lesser spirit","Shaman","Shield of Falsehood","Black Fur Boots","Spirit of Wolf","Spear of Fate","Curse of the Spirits","Tiny Gem","Bondl Felligan","Opaque Gem","Erud's Crossing","A wandering spirit","Glaron the Wicked","Envy","Woe","Tabien the Goodly","Marr's Promise","Rathe Mountains","Spirit Sentinel","Black Dire","Black Dire Pelt","Lord Ghiosk","Icon of the High Scale","Hig